ronto, we take pride in our commitment to quality and customer satisfaction. Contact us today to schedule an appointment and experience the difference our Carbon Fibre Wraps can make for your vehicle.</p>", "style": "font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:var( --e-global-color-text );font-weight:400"}], "padding": "50px 0px 50px 0px", "maxWidth": null, "background": "#FFFFFF"}], "kind": "page", "robots": "follow, index, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large", "published": null, "modified": null, "author": null, "head": {"meta": [["viewport", false, "width=device-width, initial-scale=1"], ["description", false, "Update and personalize your vehicle with 3m Carbon Fibre Wraps. Get it custom-made as per your brand requirements."], ["robots", false, "follow, index, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large"], ["og:locale", true, "en_US"], ["og:type", true, "article"], ["og:title", true, "Carbon Fibre Wraps - Vinyl Wrap Toronto"], ["og:description", true, "Update and personalize your vehicle with 3m Carbon Fibre Wraps. Get it custom-made as per your brand requirements."], ["og:url", true, "https://vinylwraptoronto.com/carbon-fibre-wraps-vinyl-wrap-toronto/"], ["og:site_name", true, "Vinyl Wrap Toronto"], ["article:publisher", true, "https://www.facebook.com/vinylwraptoronto/"], ["article:author", true, "https://www.facebook.com/BrandingCentres/"], ["og:updated_time", true, "2023-07-27T14:03:05-04:00"], ["og:image", true, "/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Vinyl-Wrap-Toronto.webp"], ["og:image:secure_url", true, "/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Vinyl-Wrap-Toronto.webp"], ["og:image:width", true, "1000"], ["og:image:height", true, "563"], ["og:image:alt", true, "Carbon Fibre Wrap"], ["og:image:type", true, "image/webp"], ["article:published_time", true, "2022-02-05T11:58:19-05:00"], ["article:modified_time", true, "2023-07-27T14:03:05-04:00"], ["twitter:card", false, "summary_large_image"], ["twitter:title", false, "Carbon